# Architecture Deep Dive

## Agent Design

Every agent inherits from `BaseAgent` and implements an `execute(task) -> dict` method:

```python
class BaseAgent(ABC):
    def __init__(self, name: str, description: str): ...
    @abstractmethod
    def execute(self, task: Dict[str, Any]) -> Dict[str, Any]: ...

**Update `.env.example`** to match what we actually use:

```powershell
@'
# UniNexus AI — Environment Configuration Template
# Copy this file to .env and adjust as needed.

APP_NAME="UniNexus AI"
ENVIRONMENT="development"

# Database
# For local development, use SQLite (no setup required):
DATABASE_URL="sqlite:///./uninexus.db"
# For production, use PostgreSQL:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/uninexus"

# Security — CHANGE THIS IN PRODUCTION
SECRET_KEY="dev-secret-key-change-in-production"

# LLM Configuration
# If Ollama is not running, the orchestrator falls back to keyword-based planning.
# OLLAMA_MODEL="llama3.2:1b"
